Employer-Sponsored Health Insurance Plan Don’t include in your medical and dental expenses any insurance premiums paid by an employer-sponsored health insurance plan unless the premiums are included on your Form W-2, Wage and Tax Statement. Also, don’t include any other medical and dental expenses paid by the plan unless the amount paid is included on your Form W-2.
